      "paperId": "f04ff795a096f4864466713c90c420c78e83e191",
      "title": "Kant e a ideia de uma hist\u00f3ria universal no contexto da Cr\u00edtica da Raz\u00e3o Pura",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "J. Klein",
          "authorId": "115802820"
